<title>POLAND: COMPUTERLAND Q1 NET FALLS TO PLN 2.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>COMPUTERLAND Q1 NET FALLS TO PLN 2.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computerland preliminary results</p>
<p>for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.86 vs	4.15</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   3.59 vs	4.03</p>
<p>    net profit				 2.45 vs	2.57</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Computerland SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 35.58 vs     35.70</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  26.75 vs     27.14</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.14 vs	1.46</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    52.49 vs	8.00</p>
<p>    financial costs			 51.77 vs	7.79</p>
<p>    investment				 0.47 vs	0.56</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
